---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import "../../styles/prepping.css";
---

<Base
  title="Health & Wellbeing"
  description="Practical fitness, nutrition, hydration and unit-conversion tools for maintaining physical capacity."
>
  <nav class="prep-modes" aria-label="Prepping sections">
    <a href="/prepping">Guide</a>
    <a href="/prepping/gear">Gear</a>
    <a href="/prepping/health" class="active">Health</a>
    <a href="/prepping/tools">Field tools</a>
    <a href="/prepping/pack">Pack list</a>
    <a href="/prepping/science">Science</a>
    <a href="/prepping/fitness">Fitness</a>
    <a href="/prepping/planting">Planting</a>
    <a href="/prepping/howto">How-to</a>
    <a href="/prepping/knots">Knots</a>
  </nav>

  <h1>Health &amp; wellbeing</h1>
  <p>
    Physical capacity is preventative infrastructure: strength, aerobic fitness,
    nutrition, hydration and recovery reduce the chance that a small problem
    becomes an emergency.
  </p>

  <div class="health-grid">
    <a class="health-card" href="/site/fitness#bmi">
      <strong>Body metrics</strong>
      <span>BMI and tape-method body-fat estimates for rough trend tracking.</span>
    </a>
    <a class="health-card" href="/site/fitness#tdee">
      <strong>Energy &amp; nutrition</strong>
      <span>BMR, TDEE, calorie targets and macro splits.</span>
    </a>
    <a class="health-card" href="/site/fitness#orm">
      <strong>Strength &amp; hydration</strong>
      <span>One-rep max estimates and daily water requirements.</span>
    </a>
    <a class="health-card" href="/site/convert?type=Mass">
      <strong>Bodyweight converter</strong>
      <span>Convert between kilograms, pounds, ounces and stone.</span>
    </a>
    <a class="health-card" href="/site/convert?type=Energy">
      <strong>Food energy converter</strong>
      <span>Convert between kilojoules, kilocalories, calories and joules.</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <p class="note-foot">
    These are estimates for planning and trend tracking, not diagnosis or medical advice.
  </p>
</Base>
